      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأرّب</span></b>  <i>He affected,</i> or <i>endeavoured to acquire,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَكَلَّفَ</span>,) <i>cunning,</i> or <i>intelligence, and excellence
of judgment,</i> (K, TA,) <i>and deceit, guile,</i> or <i>artifice, and wickedness, mischievousness,</i> or <i>malignity.</i> (TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِرْبٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأرّب فِي الأَمْرِ</span>:
see 1.

